# Files prettier must not touch:
#  - the Studio plugin ships as Luau and as an .rbxmx bundle whose bytes are
#    compared against the bundle generator (`npm run plugin:check`), so
#    reformatting either one fails the check or, worse, changes what users
#    install by hand;
#  - build output and local artefacts are not source;
#  - the SQL installer is checked by its own test, not by prettier.
public/plugins/*.luau
public/plugins/*.rbxmx
dist
node_modules
coverage
.artifacts
test-results
playwright-report
supabase/*.sql
package-lock.json
